WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:02.736
- Le'Veon, time to wake up.

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:05.739
Time to go to
the Steelers facility today.

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:09.776
It's time to finally check in
and be a good teammate.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:12.345
- Or we could never go back

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:15.248
and watch them
suffer into the ground!

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:18.018
- It's time to go in
and apologize to your teammates

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.120
tell them how much
you missed football.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.521
- You heard
what they said about you

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:22.956
those offensive linemen.

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.724
How many touchdowns
have they scored?

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.793
James Conner,
you should shave his head

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.228
when you get to camp.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:30.263
- Think big-picture, Le'Veon.

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.532
- So then what's
the bigger plan, angel?

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:34.267
- You can be a part of a winner.

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:37.737
This team can win
the Super Bowl, Le'Veon.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:38.705
And you know what that means?

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:39.873
And you know what that means?

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.241
And you know what that means?

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:43.276
More dollars.

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.812
- We could buy so many jet skis,
Le'Veon

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:46.579
if you win the Super Bowl.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:47.347
if you win the Super Bowl.

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:50.984
- Mutual funds with the extra
money, Le'Veon.

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.553
Mutual funds.

